{"id":"vod_md_2706","vodId":"2706","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"玉响第一季","name_cn":"玉响第一季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230818-1/fc2fa7ca664f372180caedfaa70c9ea8.jpg"},"summary":"沢渡枫（竹达彩奈 配音）幼年时不幸的失去了父亲，在悲痛中，坚强的她决定拾起父亲最爱的相机，通过摄影来完成对父亲的回忆和思念。在某一次拍摄中，枫偶然发现了一种名为“玉响”的光芒，为了捕捉这能够让人得到幸福的神迹，枫彻底的走上了摄影的道路。这一天，枫来到了父亲曾经生活过的小镇竹原市，在这里，她要开始她崭新的高中生活。在学校里，枫结识了一群个性可爱的朋友们。虽然毒舌但十分关心枫的塙薰（阿澄佳奈 配音），性格害羞但一直为了完成梦想而努力的樱田麻音（仪武佑子 配音）以及个性大大咧咧但心思其实十分细腻的冈崎乃理惠（井口裕香 配音），枫决定要用相机为她们制造出最美丽的玉响。一段单纯快乐的友情在少女之间展开了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-18 08:16:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/0S3qmtsk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/fn8Lf0mk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/IngeVV48/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/I5TpEAXi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/oRfWSVnE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/9J2Khx2g/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/GewPjSOX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/7BnNzzSC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/5qtzfBDj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/TmBiAhtl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/9xSMaqmG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/ivNnM9km/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230816/m8VDcr9n/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:48:51.020Z"}